# 基础词 Unit 06 短语

## 常考短语

- **be consistent with**: 与…一致 — Results are consistent with predictions. 结果与预测一致。
- **consult with**: 与…商议 — I need to consult with my lawyer. 我需要和律师商议。
- **consume a great deal of**: 消耗大量 — The project consumed a great deal of time. 项目消耗了大量时间。
- **come into contact with**: 接触到 — She came into contact with many cultures. 她接触了许多文化。
- **hold in contempt**: 轻视 — He was held in contempt. 他被轻视。
- **be content with**: 对…满意 — She is content with her job. 她对工作满意。
- **on the contrary**: 正相反 — On the contrary, I agree. 正相反，我同意。
- **contribute to**: 有助于 — Exercise contributes to health. 运动有助于健康。
- **convince sb. of**: 使某人确信 — He convinced me of his sincerity. 他让我确信了他的真诚。
- **cope with**: 应对 — She coped well with the pressure. 她很好地应对了压力。
- **at the core of**: 在…的核心 — Trust is at the core of relationships. 信任是关系的核心。
- **correspond to**: 与…对应 — The data corresponds to our findings. 数据与我们的发现一致。
- **counsel sb. to do**: 建议某人做 — The lawyer counseled him to remain silent. 律师建议他保持沉默。
- **take courage**: 鼓起勇气 — She took courage and spoke up. 她鼓起勇气大声说了出来。
- **correspond with sb.**: 与某人通信 — She corresponded with her pen pal. 她与笔友通信。
- **contrary to**: 与…相反 — Contrary to belief, bats are not blind. 与看法相反，蝙蝠不是瞎的。
- **contribute money**: 捐钱 — He contributed money to the charity. 他向慈善机构捐了钱。
- **controversial issue**: 有争议的问题 — The topic is a controversial issue. 这个话题是有争议的问题。
- **convey a message**: 传达信息 — The letter conveyed an important message. 信传达了重要信息。
- **cooperate with**: 与…合作 — The departments cooperate with each other. 各部门相互合作。

